OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton inspired lottery
OL,4,Awinner's charity work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lottery winner who gave away millions
OL,7,Fto help others in her area said Dolly
OL,8,FParton was a huge inspiration for her
OL,9,Fcharitable work.
OL,11,FFrances Connolly won #115m with her
OL,12,Fhusband Paddy in 2019 and went on to
OL,13,Fset up a trust to support good causes
OL,14,Fin the North East, where she lives.
OL,16,FHer father was a fan of country and
OL,17,Fwestern music, with Dolly Parton a
OL,18,Ffavourite. Connolly described the
OL,19,Fsinger, who died last month aged 80, as
OL,20,Fan "inspiration" for her philanthropy.
